### ====================================================================================
### WardMate Document & Form Service — LIVE AZURE TEST FILE (ALL 18 APIS THEO ACTOR)
### Base URL: https://wardmate-gateway.blackmeadow-a2f12767.japaneast.azurecontainerapps.io
### Dùng VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### ====================================================================================

@baseUrl = https://wardmate-gateway.blackmeadow-a2f12767.japaneast.azurecontainerapps.io
@contentType = application/json
@applicantId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@officerId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

# ====================================================================================
# CỤM 1: 📑 FormTemplates — Quản trị viên / Hệ thống
# ====================================================================================

### [1.1] TẠO BIỂU MẪU PHÔI MỚI (Admin)
### POST /api/v1/form-templates
# @name createTemplate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/form-templates
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "DON-XAC-NHAN-CU-TRU-TEST",
  "title": "Đơn xác nhận thông tin về cư trú (Azure Live)",
  "createdBy": "admin-system"
}

###

### [1.2] UPLOAD FILE DOCX CHO BIỂU MẪU PHÔI (Admin)
### POST /api/v1/form-templates/{templateId}/upload-docx
@templateId = {{createTemplate.response.body.id}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}/upload-docx
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mau_phoi_cu_tru.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./don_sample.docx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### [1.3] LẤY DANH SÁCH BIỂU MẪU PHÔI (Phân trang)
### GET /api/v1/form-templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/form-templates?page=1&pageSize=10&isActive=true
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [1.4] XEM CHI TIẾT 1 BIỂU MẪU PHÔI THEO ID
### GET /api/v1/form-templates/{templateId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [1.5] LẤY LINK SAS TẢI FILE PHÔI DOCX (Có thời hạn)
### GET /api/v1/form-templates/{templateId}/docx-url
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}/docx-url?validForMinutes=60
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [1.6] TẢI TRỰC TIẾP FILE PHÔI DOCX GỐC VỀ MÁY
### GET /api/v1/form-templates/{templateId}/download-docx
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/form-templates/{{templateId}}/download-docx


# ====================================================================================
# CỤM 2: 👤 Citizen — Hồ sơ người dân (Luồng Người dân)
# ====================================================================================

### [2.1] [CITIZEN] TẠO BẢN NHÁP HỒ SƠ ĐẦU TIÊN (Lưu nháp - Draft)
### POST /api/v1/citizen/submissions/draft
# @name createDraft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/citizen/submissions/draft
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="templateId"

{{templateId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="applicantId"

{{applicantId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="don_cu_tru_nhap_v1.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./don_sample.docx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### [2.2] [CITIZEN] LẤY DANH SÁCH HỒ SƠ CỦA NGƯỜI DÂN (Hồ sơ của tôi)
### GET /api/v1/citizen/submissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions?applicantId={{applicantId}}&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [2.3] [CITIZEN] XEM CHI TIẾT 1 HỒ SƠ
### GET /api/v1/citizen/submissions/{submissionId}
@submissionId = {{createDraft.response.body.submissionId}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [2.4] [CITIZEN] TẢI FILE DOCX ĐANG LƯU NHÁP VỀ MÁY ĐỂ ĐIỀN TIẾP
### GET /api/v1/citizen/submissions/{submissionId}/download-docx
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/download-docx

###

### [2.5] [CITIZEN] CẬP NHẬT BẢN NHÁP HỒ SƠ (Điền tiếp thông tin)
### PUT /api/v1/citizen/submissions/{submissionId}/draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/draft
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="applicantId"

{{applicantId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="don_cu_tru_nhap_v2.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./don_sample.docx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### [2.6] [CITIZEN] NỘP HỒ SƠ CHÍNH THỨC (Draft -> Submitted)
### POST /api/v1/citizen/submissions/{submissionId}/submit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/citizen/submissions/{{submissionId}}/submit
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "applicantId": "{{applicantId}}"
}


# ====================================================================================
# CỤM 3: 🏢 Officer — Xét duyệt hồ sơ (Front-Desk / Cán bộ)
# ====================================================================================

### [3.1] [OFFICER] LẤY DANH SÁCH HỒ SƠ ĐANG CHỜ DUYỆT (Hàng đợi xét duyệt)
### GET /api/v1/officer/submissions?status=Submitted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/officer/submissions?status=Submitted&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [3.2] [OFFICER] XEM CHI TIẾT HỒ SƠ ĐÃ NỘP
### GET /api/v1/officer/submissions/{submissionId}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/officer/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [3.3] [OFFICER] TẢI FILE DOCX ĐỂ THẨM ĐỊNH THÔNG TIN
### GET /api/v1/officer/submissions/{submissionId}/download-docx
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/officer/submissions/{{submissionId}}/download-docx

###

### [3.4] [OFFICER - NHÁNH 1] TRẢ HỒ SƠ, YÊU CẦU SỬA ĐỔI / BỔ SUNG (Submitted -> RevisionRequested)
### POST /api/v1/officer/submissions/{submissionId}/request-revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/officer/submissions/{{submissionId}}/request-revision
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "officerId": "{{officerId}}",
  "comment": "Ảnh chụp CCCD mặt sau bị mờ, vui lòng chụp lại rõ nét hơn rồi nộp lại."
}

###

### [3.5] [OFFICER - NHÁNH 2] PHÊ DUYỆT HỒ SƠ HOÀN TẤT (Submitted -> Approved)
### POST /api/v1/officer/submissions/{submissionId}/approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/api/v1/officer/submissions/{{submissionId}}/approve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "officerId": "{{officerId}}"
}


# ====================================================================================
# CỤM 4: ⚙️ WardMate.Services.DocumentForm.API (Root & Health)
# ====================================================================================

### [4.1] THÔNG TIN SERVICE GỐC
### GET /
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### [4.2] KIỂM TRA HEALTHCHECK SERVICE
### GET /health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-form/health
